"Save More on Great Food. Help Waste Less."

Suggested supporting text:

"Discover discounted surplus food from local restaurants, bakeries and shops. Reserve your favourites and collect them at a convenient time."

#### B. Discover page

Create an engaging food marketplace with:
- Search by food name or business.
- Location selection.
- Category filters.
- Price filters.
- Collection-time filters.
- Dietary filters based on verified listing information.
- Sorting by price, discount, distance or newest listing.
- Availability indicators.
