### 21. ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

The application is not complete merely because its pages render.

Consider the MVP complete only when:

- A customer can discover an available listing and complete the supported reservation flow.
- A business can create a listing and manage its orders.
- Inventory cannot be oversold through concurrent reservations.
- Payment status is verified securely when online payments are enabled.
- Collection can be recorded and verified.
- Administrators can approve businesses and moderate listings.
- Commission and order totals are calculated correctly.
- Private information is protected by server-side authorization.
- Expired, withdrawn or otherwise ineligible listings cannot be purchased.
- Critical automated tests pass.
- The application runs using documented setup instructions.
- External integrations and limitations are disclosed accurately.

